    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d290">

                <pb facs="0343" n="283" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg283"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Eustis to Mr.
                            Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-09-23"><hi rendition="#italic">September 23,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mrs. Waller’s family arrived at Paris. She has decided not to visit her husband.
                    Impossible to engage passage before October 2, on which day they will sail on
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Amsterdam</hi>.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Eustis</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
